  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building a Sustainable Environment for Sexual and Reproductive Health Care in Burundi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will build on existing SRH initiatives led by the government of Burundi, civil society organizations, as well as the Embassy of Netherlands, intended to improve women&#x2019;s reproductive health; strengthen access to quality postabortion care, contraception, and SGBV; gradually move from abortion harm reduction strategies to full access to abortion care.</narrative>
